Sync_Beat
About the Project:
Sync_Beat is a collaborative music-listening web platform designed to make listening to
music more interactive and social. The concept allows users to enjoy music
together while sharing the experience with others.

Features:
Collaborative music listening
YouTube playback
Shared listening rooms
Live chat
Shared playlists
Memories and social interaction
Responsive user interface

Technologies Used:
HTML
Web technologies

What I Learned:
This project helped me understand how a web interface can be designed around a real-world idea.
It also improved my understanding of webpage structure, user interface design, responsive layouts,
and creating a user-focused web experience
